{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Do not reprove a scorner, lest he hate you</b> — for he is wise in his own eyes." "<b>Reprove a wise man and he will love you</b> — for he desires the correction of his traits and does not consider himself wise, and they are two opposites."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:40.931112572Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}